{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42097","headline":"和朐阳载笔鲁裕见寄 · 李中","name":"和朐阳载笔鲁裕见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"燕台多事每开颜，相许论交淡薄间。\n饮兴共怜芳草岸，吟情同爱夕阳山。\n露浓小径蛩声咽，月冷空庭竹影闲。\n何事此时攀忆甚，与君俱是别乡关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42097.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42097","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}